{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──あ、すまん\r\n気にしないでくれ","trans":"──啊，抱歉。\n别在意。","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018590010","name":"透","text":"えー\r\n気になるでしょ","trans":"诶——\n会在意的吧。","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、昼食べられなくてさ\r\n大丈夫だから────","trans":"哈哈，午饭没顾上吃。\n没事的────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018590020","name":"透","text":"食べる？","trans":"要吃吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え？\r\n……え、これって","trans":"诶？\n……诶，这个是","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018590030","name":"透","text":"バレンタインのやつ\r\nお父さん用だけど","trans":"情人节的那款。\n虽然是我爸的份。","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-25","name":"プロデューサー","text":"えっ……！\r\nい、いや、それは頂けないよ……！","trans":"诶……！\n不、不行，那个我不能收……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018590040","name":"透","text":"ふふっ\r\nなんで","trans":"呵呵。\n为什么？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-27","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いや、だって──────","trans":"不是，可是──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018590050","name":"透","text":"ふふふっ\r\nわかんない……なんか","trans":"呵呵呵。\n不知道……总觉得。","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018590060","name":"透","text":"こうするために\r\n買ったんだったかも","trans":"说不定就是为了\n这么做才买的。","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}